// FSM to handle specimen_2 chasing the player
// This is janky and buggy and the native pathfinding isn't the best, but it works
// enemy_specimen_2's attack "Is Shooting", but the FSM checks the enemy's current
//  distance from the player and only "Fires" when it's close
// This is to emulate a melee attack, because the native melee attack was failing 
//  to fire when specimen_2 was chasing the player as enemies need to exit the 
//  chase state before attacking which then make the enemy out of range and unable 
//  to melee attack...

image enemy_specimen_2 0 0
sound enemy_hit

state IDLE NONE 0
frame 0 0.25 0 0 0 NONE
frame 1 0 0 0 0 SETVAR dist PLAYERDISTANCE
frame 1 0 0 0 0 JUMPIFLESS dist 50 HIT
frame 1 0 0 0 0 JUMPIFGREATER dist 600 DEAD
frame 1 0 0 0 0 JUMPIFGREATER dist 50 CHASE

state SEE CHASE 0
frame 0 0.25 0 0 0 NONE

state CHASE IDLE 0
frame 0 0.25 0 0 0 NONE
frame 1 0 0 0 0 SETVAR dist PLAYERDISTANCE
frame 1 0 0 0 0 JUMPIFLESS dist 50 HIT
frame 1 0 0 0 0 JUMPIFGREATER dist 600 DEAD
frame 1 0 0 0 0 JUMPIFGREATER dist 50 CHASE

state HIT CHASE 0 
frame 1 0.25 0 0 0 READY
frame 1 0.25 0 0 0 ATTACK
frame 1 0.25 0 0 0 SOUND enemy_hit
frame 2 0.25 0 0 0 READY

state DEAD NONE 0 
frame 0 0.25 0 0 0 NONE
